{
  "uid": "frappe-performance",
  "title": "Frappe \u2014 Website Performance",
  "description": "Blackbox probes of the Frappe site: uptime, response time, phase breakdown, status codes and TLS expiry. Scraped every 30s by the stack's own Prometheus.",
